---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';import {objects} from '../../data/objects';
---
<Base title="Objects, closely" description="Two public-domain museum images, with material, attribution and uncertainty made visible." section="objects">
<header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">The material record · The Metropolitan Museum of Art</span><h1>Objects,<br/>closely.</h1><p class="deck">Two carved surfaces. Two catalogue attributions. A small study collection for looking at material, narrative and the limits of what an object record tells us.</p></header>
<div class="object-pair">{objects.map(o=><article><a href={`/objects/${o.id}/`}><img src={`/objects/${o.id}-960.webp`} alt={`${o.title}, ${o.material}; museum photograph`} width="960" height="900"/><span class="eyebrow">{o.material}</span><h2>{o.title}</h2></a><p>{o.date} · {o.certainty}</p><p>{o.looking}</p><a class="underlink" href={`/objects/${o.id}/`}>Inspect the record ↗</a></article>)}</div>
<section class="comparison"><span class="eyebrow">Read across the collection</span><h2>A comparison,<br/>with limits.</h2><p>Images are fitted independently. They are not shown at the same physical scale. Catalogue dates are approximate, and regional attribution is not excavation provenance.</p><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Object comparison table"><table><caption>Catalogue comparison</caption><thead><tr><th>Record</th>{objects.map(o=><th scope="col">{o.title}</th>)}</tr></thead><tbody>{[['Date','date'],['Material','material'],['Regional attribution','origin'],['Accession','accession']].map(([label,key])=><tr><th scope="row">{label}</th>{objects.map(o=><td>{o[key as keyof typeof o]}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div><a class="underlink" href="/heritage/">Return to the archaeological landscape ↗</a></section>
</Base>
<style>.page-heading h1{font-size:clamp(70px,11vw,170px)}.object-pair{background:#20352e;color:#eeeae1;padding:60px 7%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8%}.object-pair img{width:100%;height:430px;object-fit:contain;background:#eeeae1;margin-bottom:35px}.object-pair h2{font-size:46px;margin:20px 0}.object-pair p{line-height:1.8}.comparison{padding:80px 7%;max-width:1300px}.comparison>p{max-width:650px;line-height:1.9}.table-scroll{overflow:auto;margin:35px 0}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:560px;text-align:left;font-size:14px}th,td{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px 15px}caption{text-align:left;margin-bottom:20px}@media(max-width:700px){.object-pair{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:55px}.object-pair img{height:310px}.object-pair h2{font-size:36px}}</style>
